AUDIO: 'need to know at a minimum? Well, the very first one that I personally like to use is AssemblyAI, and it takes care of transcribing the recording. Because if you\'re editing raw footage, you need a way for your AI model to understand what\'s actually'

[05:49] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'happening in the video. At least in my case, when it comes to educational content, the essence of a video is what is said in it . Personally, we use AssemblyAI for this because we believe they have a good ratio of'

